        <briefdescription>
<para>Compiles a shader program and constructs a render-ready <ref refid="structshader_1_1_pass" kindref="compound">Pass</ref>. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Compiles and links the program via <ref refid="structshader_1_1_compiler_1a1fc06cd95371860a447a28fcf9000d35" kindref="member">Compiler::build</ref>. Bakes a setUniforms lambda that captures all active Shadertoy uniform <ref refid="juce__gl_8h_1a5ac0f3c4d7fafd42b284b5487a791017" kindref="member" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/JUCE/docs/tagfile.xml">GLint</ref> locations by value. iChannel locations are discovered from <ref refid="structconfig_1_1_file_1_1_shaders_1_1_buffer" kindref="compound">config::File::Shaders::Buffer</ref> (SSOT). Inactive uniforms (location -1) become GL no-ops inside the lambda. The <ref refid="structshader_1_1_pass" kindref="compound">Pass</ref> returned has fbos = std::nullopt — the orchestrator (<ref refid="structshader_1_1_controller_1ad7197a891a2a6990151c91e31fd41c59" kindref="member">Controller::loadShaders</ref>) wraps in a <ref refid="structshader_1_1_swap_chain" kindref="compound">SwapChain</ref> for buffer passes.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>vertexSource</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Vertex shader source. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>fragmentSource</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Fragment shader source (single compilation unit). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>context</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Active OpenGL context. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>error</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Receives error message on failure. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para><ref refid="structshader_1_1_pass" kindref="compound">Pass</ref> with program + baked setUniforms. fbos is std::nullopt. On compile/link failure, returns <ref refid="structshader_1_1_pass" kindref="compound">Pass</ref> with program == nullptr. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
