    <briefdescription>
<para>Static shader program builder — compiles, links, and constructs <ref refid="structshader_1_1_pass" kindref="compound">Pass</ref>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Pure static utility. No instance state.</para>
<para><ref refid="structshader_1_1_compiler_1a1fc06cd95371860a447a28fcf9000d35" kindref="member">build()</ref> compiles and links a shader program from vertex + fragment sources. <ref refid="structshader_1_1_compiler_1adee5f8ed1b195826f783d1224c8077f7" kindref="member">buildPass()</ref> composes a fully-resolved <ref refid="structshader_1_1_pass" kindref="compound">Pass</ref>: linked program + a baked setUniforms lambda that captures all active <ref refid="juce__gl_8h_1a5ac0f3c4d7fafd42b284b5487a791017" kindref="member" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/JUCE/docs/tagfile.xml">GLint</ref> locations by value at build time. No <ref refid="structjuce_1_1OpenGLShaderProgram_1_1Uniform" kindref="compound" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/JUCE/docs/tagfile.xml">juce::OpenGLShaderProgram::Uniform</ref> objects are constructed.</para>
<para>Thread contract: ALL methods GL THREAD only. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
